    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4833" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλωπός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
